WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.174
The thing about 
looking inward

00:00:02.174 --> 00:00:03.772
is that it can be scary,

00:00:04.149 --> 00:00:06.314
especially if you're doing 
it for the first&nbsp;time.

00:00:06.314 --> 00:00:08.799
But the truth is you 
never truly start living

00:00:08.799 --> 00:00:11.841
until you learn to live 
from the inside&nbsp;out.

00:00:11.841 --> 00:00:13.723
And in unlocking potential,

00:00:13.723 --> 00:00:16.244
we need to look inward 
to identify the things

00:00:16.244 --> 00:00:18.286
that give us a deep&nbsp;
sense of fulfillment,

00:00:18.746 --> 00:00:21.077
the things that give 
us the deepest joy,

00:00:21.077 --> 00:00:22.462
and then weave them into

00:00:22.462 --> 00:00:24.315
the patterns&nbsp;of our daily routines.

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:26.665
When you cease to 
work and you live,

00:00:27.058 --> 00:00:28.853
when passion 
becomes a career,

00:00:28.853 --> 00:00:30.245
you don't just excel,

00:00:30.738 --> 00:00:32.490
you become unstoppable.

